English
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This repository is the **interface demo** of a private project. It is public
only so that people can see what it looks like.

PERMITTED
  · Viewing and reading the contents of this repository
  · Opening and interacting with the page in a browser
  · Quoting brief excerpts or screenshots for the purpose of review or
    commentary, provided this file is included in full

NOT PERMITTED
  · Copying, modifying, distributing, or republishing any part of this
    repository
  · Using the code or assets in your own project
  · Commercial use

In short: **look, but no license is granted.**

Please contact the repository owner for permission.

